  "modern_adaptations": [
    "Retain modern Nether terrain, replace only gravel surface identity; keep existing ore gravel feature.",
    "Dahlia patches use modern surface height with source temperature rules and 16/64 patch attempts. Allium patch 8 in swamp.",
    "Retain native non-base copper oxidation and waxing while applying copper source metal-door interactions.",
    "Retain native suspicious stew behavior for vanilla flowers; new Dahlia is a BushBlock and does not invent a source stew effect.",
    "Native copper trapdoor remains 6 ingots producing 2; only its shape changes to a unique 3x3 layout to preserve the exact R196 copper bars recipe."
  ]
}
